# BAWAAL V1 — Master Full-Stack Lock

Production-final contract for onboarding UI + Supabase auth/profiles. Do **not** restyle, reorder, or rewire unless the user explicitly unlocks this rule.

## 1. Frontend UI & design system

| Token | Value |
|---|---|
| Global background | Pitch black `#000000` |
| Primary accent | Electric orange `#FF6600` |
| Input containers | Dark grey `#1E1E22`, `borderRadius: 12` |
| Focus state | `1.5px` border `#FF6600`; web `outlineStyle: 'none'` |
| Typography | Bold white body; orange accents for links / checkboxes |
| Brand | Centered `BAWAAL_white_full.png` + `BAWAAL_tagline.png` (“own your chaos”) on entry, registration, Terms, OTP |

## 2. Registration layout (`RoleSelection.js`)

1. Username (full width)
2. Real Name (full width)
3. Age \| Gender (2-column)
4. Email (full width)
5. Phone (full width)
6. City, Country + far-right flag badge (**32×24**), regional helper when matched
7. Category \| Role (2-column) — category from `BAWAAL_SPORTS_WITHOUT_ALL`
8. Footer: Terms checkbox (orange link) + full-width orange **pill** **Continue** — **no** login redirect links

## 3. Modal architecture

### Terms
- Pitch black; custom web scrollbar (track `#0A0A0C`/`#000`, thumb `#FF6600`, hover `#FF8533`, 6–8px, radius 4)
- Central logo + tagline; full-width orange accept pill

### OTP
- Pitch black; central logo + tagline
- 4 boxes: fill `#1E1E22`, focus `#FF6600`, white digits
- Manual **SUBMIT / VERIFY** only — never auto-verify on 4th digit
- Dev bypass: `+917993992315` / `1234` (`authOtp.js`)

## 4. Backend (Supabase)

### Client
- `src/services/supabase.js` → `lib/supabase.js`
- `EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL` + `EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`
- AsyncStorage session persistence (`persistSession` / `autoRefreshToken`)

### `public.profiles` (RLS on)
- `id uuid primary key references auth.users (id) on delete cascade`
- `username`, `real_name`, `age`, `gender`, `email`, `phone`, `country`, `category`, `role`, `created_at`
- Ensure SQL: `supabase/ENSURE_PROFILES_SPORTS_HUBS.sql` (+ `supabase_schema.sql`)
- Types: `src/types/profile.js`

### Auth & persistence
- Continue → `supabase.auth.signInWithOtp({ phone })` via `sendPhoneOtp`
- SUBMIT → `supabase.auth.verifyOtp({ phone, token, type: 'sms' })` via `verifyPhoneOtp`
- Then `upsertRegisteredProfile` with the V1 form fields keyed by auth user id
- Soft-fail offline / schema mismatch — still complete local registration

